---
description: Core project behavior and architecture constraints for all work in this repository.
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---
- Read `AGENTS.md` before making architectural changes.
- Follow the active milestone in `docs/MILESTONES.md`.
- Keep every change buildable and testable.
- CMake is the source of truth for builds; do not hand-author `.sln` or `.vcxproj` files.
- Gameplay must stay independent from OS APIs and direct backend-specific calls.
- Do not silently expand scope into later milestones.
- When a requirement conflicts with portability, explain the conflict and implement the smallest clean platform boundary.
